<title>PHILIPPINES: TABLE-Philippine Mariveles grains arrival schedule.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Philippine Mariveles grains arrival schedule.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Asian Terminals Inc's schedule of ship arrivals at the Mariveles grains terminal, for July.</p>
<p>Vessel	   Date of	Commodity		Quantity</p>
<p>		   Arrival</p>
<p>Sammi Manna    July 6     Chinese yellow corn   14,153 tonnes</p>
<p>Torm Marta     July 12    Soybean meal	    52,800 tonnes</p>
<p>Manifest/PKWN  July 12    U.S. wheat		52,499 tonnes</p>
<p>Ermis	    July 17 yellow corn/soybean meal 55,000 tonnes</p>
<p>Baia Arama     July 24    Soybean meal	    52,000 tonnes</p>
<p>Ino		July 26    U.S. wheat		16,500 tonnes</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom (63 2) 841-8936, Fax 817-6267</p>
